WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:09.533
Group the meetings of one job, like a drydock. Every open point gets a number, an owner, a due date, and a full history.

00:10.300 --> 00:17.433
Omar Haddad: The OEM engineer arrives on Monday the twenty third, so the tail shaft survey is on hold until then.

00:17.767 --> 00:20.900
During the meeting, open points light up as they are discussed.

00:21.667 --> 00:28.233
After the meeting, the AI reads the whole meeting and suggests the changes. Nothing changes until you accept.

00:29.000 --> 00:33.867
The minutes carry one points table, from meeting to meeting, until every point is closed.

00:34.633 --> 00:36.167
Meetings that remember.
